is not necessarily consistent
between Trace and Debugger

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:25.040
and Error Reporting, but we
are, in a matter of, let's say,

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.045
months, I think--

00:16:26.045 --> 00:16:28.440
MORGAN MCLEAN: In Trace, weeks.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:31.070
SHARAT SHROFF: We will
have more and more support.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:32.450
MARK MANDEL: We won't lock
