00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.866
I wouldn't want
to do that to you.

00:16:33.866 --> 00:16:35.082
I understand.

00:16:35.082 --> 00:16:36.540
MORGAN MCLEAN:
Yeah, but certainly,

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.170
in the upcoming quarter
and the quarter following,

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:41.620
at least for Trace-- I can
speak specifically for Trace,

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:43.650
but I believe it's
true for the others,

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:48.790
that support for GCE and
GKE is our top priority,

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.630
because the experience
