00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:57.151
excellent on those
other Compute platforms.

00:16:57.151 --> 00:16:58.900
MARK MANDEL: And just
so we're clear, too.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:02.219
Is that both App Engine
standard and flexible?

00:17:02.219 --> 00:17:03.510
MORGAN MCLEAN: I think that's--

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:05.450
SHARAT SHROFF: It's App
Engine standard right now.

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:06.470
MARK MANDEL: OK, cool.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:08.486
All right, so I'll
