except the languages that are
fleshed out are different.

00:19:21.262 --> 00:19:22.970
MORGAN MCLEAN: That's
a good point, yeah.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.178
SHARAT SHROFF: Debugger has
only got a few languages,

