00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.740
or you can create custom ones.

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:27.015
So every day, you're
submitting data for Trace,

00:22:27.015 --> 00:22:29.390
whether that's because you
have an App Engine application

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:31.556
or you're submitting it
through one of our libraries

00:22:31.556 --> 00:22:34.150
or through the trace
API-- every day,

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:36.810
we go and do comparisons
day by day and version

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:39.755
by version of the latency
